    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382040/extras/89ddff4a431c50561017546ed3cac7cf.avif?t=1683248594\" /></span><br>HellCat 2: The Riot Inferno is an alternate history of a hurricane cat in a red scarf. More enemies and bosses. More weapons and ammo. More lives and deadly dangers. More drive and hellish meat.<br>   Break through the hordes of enemies with your own sharp claws or a set of powerful firearms. Use cover and other tactics to turn the defense into a devastating attack. And in the room between levels, a friend will be waiting for you, where you can take a breath and buy upgrades.<br><br>Top-down slasher shooter game. The task at each level is to destroy all enemies and then a portal to the next level appears.<br><br>Peculiarities:<br>--- Driving soundtrack<br>--- Potato system requirements<br>--- High difficulty and pace of the game<br>--- A lot of shooting and explosions (well, a lot)",
